html 
    head 
        title nweb Lab2 - SQL injection


        h1 Task 1 - SQL injection
        hr
        h2
            a(href='/2' title='Bad Auth') Task 2 - Broken Authentication
        
        hr
        if sqlVul === true
            h2 Page is vulnerable
        else
            h2 Page is not vulnerable

        form(action="/sql_change" method="POST")
            button(type="submit") Toggle vulnerability

        hr

        h2 Enter name of place to show all the people living there (example: Zagreb)
        h2 Upute: Tipicni primjer sql ubacivanja (tautologije): nepoznato_ime' OR '1'='1 -> ovo ce ispisati cijelu tablicu kad je ranjivost ukljucena, a nece ispisati nista od podataka kad je iskljucena.

        form(action="/place", method="get")
            input(type="text", name="location")
            button(type="submit") Search

        hr

        if data
            table 
                thead
                    tr
                        th ID
                        th Korisnik
                        th Informacije
                        th Mjesto
                tbody
                    each x in data
                        tr
                            td= x.id
                            td= x.username
                            td= x.information
                            td= x.place
